[DONE] To help minimize API calls, for Hue use group API calls when applicable. (reference references/Hue - Groups and Scenes)
  Room on/off/brightness already used native grouped_light calls. Extended it to scene apply: a scene with an empty palette (brightness-only) or a single color drives every member to the same state, so it now collapses to one grouped_light PUT per linked group instead of fanning out per light. Multi-color palettes still fan out (each light needs a distinct color).

